 | **Priority** | Calls the next eligible ticket **only** among priority candidates (includes 80+ per configuration). |
 | **Normal** | Calls the next eligible ticket **only** among normal candidates. |
 
+---
+
+The **CallNextTicket** action implements the selection logic for the three button modes. It performs a transaction that locks the target queue, applies the deterministic ordering, evaluates the fairness rule (3 consecutive priority calls), and atomically marks exactly one waiting ticket as `called`. The action ensures that no two concurrent attendants can call the same ticket.
+
+
 After each call, the ticket leaves the waiting queue and enters the session/display call history.
 
